From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:34:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] droid-util: pick a mix port for the in-call input, never
 a device port
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Backport of mer-hybris/pulseaudio-modules-droid commit df044b0e2450
("common: Be more strict about input mix port selection", Enni
Hämäläinen), which the Droidian fork this recipe builds does not have.

In call mode stream_select_mix_port() takes the sink of the first route
that has the Telephony Rx device among its sources. The MT6739 policy
configuration routes "Voice Call In" straight to output devices as well
(Earpiece, Speaker, Wired Headset, ... - the "Audio patch from 'Voice
Call In' to 'Earpiece' not implemented" lines at start-up), so the
first such route's sink is the Earpiece device port. Reopening the
primary input stream in the voicecall profile - which is what a source
port change does, for instance audiod setting input-builtin_mic when the
speaker is switched on during a call with a capture stream open - then
hands that device port to stream_config_fill() as the mix port, and
PulseAudio aborts:

  Assertion 'mix_port->port_type == DM_CONFIG_TYPE_MIX_PORT' failed at
  src/common/droid-util.c:1337, function stream_config_fill()

Only accept a route whose sink is a mix port, and only device ports as
its sources; the VoIP branch likewise only takes mix ports.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/mer-hybris/pulseaudio-modules-droid/commit/df044b0e245008b69b11b72b2b4f2886f593322f]
---
 src/common/droid-util.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/common/droid-util.c b/src/common/droid-util.c
index 38ac019..2dcab87 100644
--- a/src/common/droid-util.c
+++ b/src/common/droid-util.c
@@ -1444,6 +1444,9 @@ static dm_config_port *stream_select_mix_port(pa_droid_stream *stream) {
             if (port->role != DM_CONFIG_ROLE_SINK)
                 continue;
 
+            if (port->port_type != DM_CONFIG_TYPE_MIX_PORT)
+                continue;
+
             if (port->flags & AUDIO_INPUT_FLAG_VOIP_TX) {
                 selected_port = port;
                 goto done;
@@ -1461,7 +1464,14 @@ static dm_config_port *stream_select_mix_port(pa_droid_stream *stream) {
                 if (port->role != DM_CONFIG_ROLE_SOURCE)
                     continue;
 
+                if (port->port_type != DM_CONFIG_TYPE_DEVICE_PORT)
+                    continue;
+
                 if (port->type == AUDIO_DEVICE_IN_TELEPHONY_RX) {
+                    if (route->sink->port_type != DM_CONFIG_TYPE_MIX_PORT) {
+                        pa_log_debug("Input device in odd place.");
+                        continue;
+                    }
                     selected_port = route->sink;
                     goto done;
                 }
-- 
